  "model_runtime_contract": {
    "input_root": "NORDIC_INPUT_ROOT",
    "team_input_root": "NORDIC_TEAM_INPUT_ROOT",
    "output_root": "NORDIC_OUTPUT_ROOT",
    "blog_root": "NORDIC_BLOG_ROOT",
    "log_root": "NORDIC_LOG_ROOT",
    "logical_date": "NORDIC_LOGICAL_DATE",
    "run_id": "NORDIC_RUN_ID",
    "random_seed": "NORDIC_RANDOM_SEED",
    "simulation_count": "NORDIC_N_SIMULATIONS"
  },
  "known_gaps": [
    "The retired master script invoked the model and converter from mutable home-directory worktrees without pinned inputs, an explicit logical date, a deterministic seed, or semantic output validation.",
    "Official startlist acquisition and identity normalization are not yet normalized into a hosted, fixture-backed contract.",
    "The current R model emits probability workbooks only; publication must not reference legacy optional points JSON unless it actually exists.",
    "The R model stores one result per team category, so multiple same-category team events on one logical date are unsupported and must block.",
    "Network startlist acquisition, deterministic simulation, semantic validation, Hugo rendering, and bounded publication remain future slices."
